Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: DaisyDisk-style terminal disk-usage map
 rings scans a path and shows a DaisyDisk-style sunburst of disk use
 plus a largest-first list. Drill into directories, mark waste, and
 delete only after an explicit confirm.
 .
 On Unix the only library dependency is libc. rings help prints the
 full key list. --plain, --csv, and --json write parseable output
 without opening the TUI.
